{"seq":3,"slug":"ad-monetization-mediation","title":"广告变现与聚合优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-analytics/monetization-analytics/ad-monetization-mediation","wordCount":1476,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"广告变现与聚合优化\">广告变现与聚合优化</h1><h2 id=\"广告变现在游戏中的定位\">广告变现在游戏中的定位</h2><p>并非所有游戏都适合纯 IAP 变现。对于超休闲、休闲、和部分中度游戏，广告收入占总收入的 50-90%。即使是以 IAP 为主的中重度游戏，混合变现（Hybrid Monetization）也已成为 2025-2026 年的行业标准——用广告覆盖非付费用户的 LTV 贡献。</p>\n<p>广告变现的核心公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Ad Revenue</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>DAU</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>Ad Impressions/User</mtext><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mtext>eCPM</mtext><mn>1000</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ad Revenue} = \\text{DAU} \\times \\text{Ad Impressions/User} \\times \\frac{\\text{eCPM}}{1000}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ad Revenue</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DAU</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ad Impressions/User</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eCPM</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个优化杠杆：更多用户看广告（渗透率）、每人看更多广告（频次）、每次展示更值钱（eCPM）。但三者同样存在权衡——过高的广告频次伤害留存，渗透率的天花板受制于 UX 设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>广告变现与聚合优化的关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>eCPM（effective Cost Per Mille）</strong>：每千次展示的有效收入，是广告变现的核心效率指标</li>\n<li><strong>广告聚合（Mediation）</strong>：同时接入多个广告网络，通过竞价或优先级排序为每次展示选择最高出价</li>\n<li><strong>瀑布流 vs 实时竞价</strong>：串行按历史价排序请求（传统）vs 并行所有网络同时出价（现代）</li>\n<li><strong>混合变现（Hybrid）</strong>：IAP + IAA 协同——按付费倾向分层差异化广告策略</li>\n<li><strong>激励视频（Rewarded Video）</strong>：用户主动观看换取奖励，eCPM 最高且体验最优的广告形式</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"广告形式与适用场景\">广告形式与适用场景</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>广告形式</th>\n<th>eCPM 范围</th>\n<th>用户体验影响</th>\n<th>适用品类</th>\n<th>渗透率基准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>激励视频 (Rewarded Video)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>60</td>\n<td>低（用户主动选择）</td>\n<td>全品类</td>\n<td>40-70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插屏广告 (Interstitial)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>25</td>\n<td>中高（强制打断）</td>\n<td>休闲/超休闲</td>\n<td>80-95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Banner</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>3</td>\n<td>低（但占屏幕空间）</td>\n<td>超休闲</td>\n<td>90-100%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原生广告 (Native)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>15</td>\n<td>低（融入内容）</td>\n<td>模拟经营/社交</td>\n<td>30-50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可试玩广告 (Playable)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>80</td>\n<td>中（用户参与度高）</td>\n<td>交叉推广</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"激励视频-广告变现的支柱\">激励视频：广告变现的支柱</h3><p>激励视频是游戏广告的最优解——用户自愿观看以换取游戏内奖励，广告主获得高完播率，开发者获得高 eCPM：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"REWARDED_VIDEO_PLACEMENTS = {&#10;    &#39;extra_life&#39;: {&#10;        &#39;trigger&#39;: &#39;关卡失败&#39;,&#10;        &#39;reward&#39;: &#39;复活一次&#39;,&#10;        &#39;daily_cap&#39;: 5,&#10;        &#39;cooldown_minutes&#39;: 3,&#10;        &#39;avg_ecpm&#39;: 35.0,&#10;    },&#10;    &#39;double_reward&#39;: {&#10;        &#39;trigger&#39;: &#39;关卡通关结算&#39;,&#10;        &#39;reward&#39;: &#39;奖励翻倍&#39;,&#10;        &#39;daily_cap&#39;: 10,&#10;        &#39;cooldown_minutes&#39;: 0,&#10;        &#39;avg_ecpm&#39;: 28.0,&#10;    },&#10;    &#39;free_currency&#39;: {&#10;        &#39;trigger&#39;: &#39;主界面入口&#39;,&#10;        &#39;reward&#39;: &#39;50 钻石&#39;,&#10;        &#39;daily_cap&#39;: 3,&#10;        &#39;cooldown_minutes&#39;: 30,&#10;        &#39;avg_ecpm&#39;: 22.0,&#10;    },&#10;    &#39;speed_up&#39;: {&#10;        &#39;trigger&#39;: &#39;建造/研究倒计时&#39;,&#10;        &#39;reward&#39;: &#39;立即完成&#39;,&#10;        &#39;daily_cap&#39;: 8,&#10;        &#39;cooldown_minutes&#39;: 5,&#10;        &#39;avg_ecpm&#39;: 25.0,&#10;    },&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REWARDED_VIDEO_PLACEMENTS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'extra_life'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'trigger'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'关卡失败'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'reward'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'复活一次'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'daily_cap'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'cooldown_minutes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'avg_ecpm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">35.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'double_reward'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'trigger'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'关卡通关结算'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'reward'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'奖励翻倍'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'daily_cap'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'cooldown_minutes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'avg_ecpm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">28.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'free_currency'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'trigger'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'主界面入口'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'reward'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'50 钻石'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'daily_cap'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'cooldown_minutes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'avg_ecpm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">22.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'speed_up'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'trigger'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'建造/研究倒计时'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'reward'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'立即完成'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'daily_cap'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'cooldown_minutes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'avg_ecpm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"广告聚合-mediation\">广告聚合（Mediation）</h2><h3 id=\"为什么需要聚合\">为什么需要聚合</h3><p>单一广告网络（如 AdMob、Unity Ads）无法保证每一次广告请求都有最高价的填充。聚合平台同时接入多个广告网络，通过竞价或优先级排序为每次展示选择出价最高的广告源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    APP[游戏客户端] --&gt; MED[聚合 SDK&lt;br/&gt;MAX/ironSource/AdMob]&#10;    MED --&gt; BID[实时竞价 Bidding]&#10;    MED --&gt; WF[瀑布流 Waterfall]&#10;    BID --&gt; N1[Meta Audience Network]&#10;    BID --&gt; N2[Unity Ads]&#10;    BID --&gt; N3[AppLovin]&#10;    WF --&gt; N4[AdMob]&#10;    WF --&gt; N5[Vungle]&#10;    WF --&gt; N6[Mintegral]&#10;    N1 --&gt; WIN[最高出价胜出]&#10;    N2 --&gt; WIN&#10;    N3 --&gt; WIN&#10;    N4 --&gt; WIN&#10;    N5 --&gt; WIN&#10;    N6 --&gt; WIN&#10;    WIN --&gt; AD[展示广告]\">flowchart TB\n    APP[游戏客户端] --&gt; MED[聚合 SDK&lt;br/&gt;MAX/ironSource/AdMob]\n    MED --&gt; BID[实时竞价 Bidding]\n    MED --&gt; WF[瀑布流 Waterfall]\n    BID --&gt; N1[Meta Audience Network]\n    BID --&gt; N2[Unity Ads]\n    BID --&gt; N3[AppLovin]\n    WF --&gt; N4[AdMob]\n    WF --&gt; N5[Vungle]\n    WF --&gt; N6[Mintegral]\n    N1 --&gt; WIN[最高出价胜出]\n    N2 --&gt; WIN\n    N3 --&gt; WIN\n    N4 --&gt; WIN\n    N5 --&gt; WIN\n    N6 --&gt; WIN\n    WIN --&gt; AD[展示广告]</pre><h3 id=\"瀑布流-vs-实时竞价\">瀑布流 vs 实时竞价</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>瀑布流 (Waterfall)</th>\n<th>实时竞价 (In-App Bidding)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>机制</td>\n<td>按历史 eCPM 排序依次请求</td>\n<td>所有网络同时出价，最高者胜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eCPM 数据</td>\n<td>手动更新/定期拉取</td>\n<td>实时真实出价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>高（串行请求）</td>\n<td>低（并行竞价）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化成本</td>\n<td>需人工调序</td>\n<td>全自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收入效率</td>\n<td>基线</td>\n<td>+15-30%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行业趋势</td>\n<td>逐步淘汰</td>\n<td>2026 年主流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>2026 年最佳实践：Hybrid（混合竞价 + 瀑布兜底）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def hybrid_mediation_request(ad_unit, user_context):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;混合聚合：竞价优先 + 瀑布兜底&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    bidding_responses = parallel_bid_request(&#10;        networks=[&#39;meta&#39;, &#39;unity&#39;, &#39;applovin&#39;, &#39;mintegral&#39;],&#10;        ad_unit=ad_unit,&#10;        user_context=user_context,&#10;        timeout_ms=800&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    highest_bid = max(bidding_responses, key=lambda r: r.cpm, default=None)&#10;&#10;    if highest_bid and highest_bid.cpm &gt;= FLOOR_PRICE:&#10;        return highest_bid&#10;&#10;    for waterfall_entry in get_waterfall_config(ad_unit):&#10;        response = waterfall_entry.network.request(ad_unit, user_context)&#10;        if response.filled:&#10;            return response&#10;&#10;    return None  # No fill\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hybrid_mediation_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ad_unit, user_context):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"混合聚合：竞价优先 + 瀑布兜底\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bidding_responses </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parallel_bid_request(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        networks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'meta'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'applovin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mintegral'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        ad_unit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ad_unit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        user_context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user_context,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        timeout_ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    highest_bid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bidding_responses, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r: r.cpm, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> highest_bid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> highest_bid.cpm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> FLOOR_PRICE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> highest_bid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> waterfall_entry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_waterfall_config(ad_unit):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> waterfall_entry.network.request(ad_unit, user_context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.filled:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # No fill</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ecpm-优化\">eCPM 优化</h2><h3 id=\"影响-ecpm-的因素\">影响 eCPM 的因素</h3><p>eCPM（effective Cost Per Mille）不是固定值——它受多个因素影响：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因素</th>\n<th>影响程度</th>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地区 (Geo)</td>\n<td>极高（T1 vs T3 差 5-10 倍）</td>\n<td>按地区设置差异化频次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广告形式</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>优先高 eCPM 形式（激励视频）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户参与度</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>高参与用户展示更多激励视频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>季节性</td>\n<td>中（Q4 圣诞季 +30-50%）</td>\n<td>根据季节调节频次上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广告网络竞争</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>接入更多竞价网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>填充率</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>瀑布兜底提升填充</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"地理分层定价\">地理分层定价</h3><p>不同地区的广告主预算差异巨大——同一激励视频展示在美国值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi>e</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>M</mi><mtext>，在印度可能只值</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40 eCPM，在印度可能只值</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，在印度可能只值</span></span></span></span></span>3：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按地区和广告形式统计 eCPM 表现&#10;SELECT&#10;  country_tier,&#10;  ad_format,&#10;  COUNT(*) AS impressions,&#10;  ROUND(SUM(revenue) / COUNT(*) * 1000, 2) AS ecpm,&#10;  ROUND(AVG(fill_rate) * 100, 1) AS fill_rate_pct,&#10;  ROUND(AVG(show_rate) * 100, 1) AS show_rate_pct&#10;FROM ad_impressions&#10;WHERE date &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;7 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY country_tier, ad_format&#10;ORDER BY country_tier, ecpm DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按地区和广告形式统计 eCPM 表现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  country_tier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ad_format,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> impressions,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(revenue) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ecpm,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fill_rate) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fill_rate_pct,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(show_rate) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> show_rate_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ad_impressions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> country_tier, ad_format</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> country_tier, ecpm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"a-b-测试广告频次\">A/B 测试广告频次</h3><p>广告频次与留存的权衡需要精确实验：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 广告频次对次日留存的影响&#10;SELECT&#10;  ads_seen_bucket,&#10;  COUNT(DISTINCT player_id) AS users,&#10;  AVG(d1_retained) AS d1_retention,&#10;  AVG(daily_ad_revenue) AS avg_ad_revenue_per_user&#10;FROM (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    player_id,&#10;    CASE&#10;      WHEN daily_ads_seen = 0 THEN &#39;0 ads&#39;&#10;      WHEN daily_ads_seen BETWEEN 1 AND 3 THEN &#39;1-3 ads&#39;&#10;      WHEN daily_ads_seen BETWEEN 4 AND 7 THEN &#39;4-7 ads&#39;&#10;      WHEN daily_ads_seen BETWEEN 8 AND 12 THEN &#39;8-12 ads&#39;&#10;      ELSE &#39;13+ ads&#39;&#10;    END AS ads_seen_bucket,&#10;    d1_retained,&#10;    daily_ad_revenue&#10;  FROM daily_player_ad_stats&#10;)&#10;GROUP BY ads_seen_bucket&#10;ORDER BY MIN(daily_ads_seen);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 广告频次对次日留存的影响</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ads_seen_bucket,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> player_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(d1_retained) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d1_retention,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(daily_ad_revenue) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_ad_revenue_per_user</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    player_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_ads_seen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0 ads'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_ads_seen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '1-3 ads'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_ads_seen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '4-7 ads'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_ads_seen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '8-12 ads'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '13+ ads'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ads_seen_bucket,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    d1_retained,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    daily_ad_revenue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_player_ad_stats</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ads_seen_bucket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(daily_ads_seen);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"混合变现策略\">混合变现策略</h2><h3 id=\"iap-iaa-协同\">IAP + IAA 协同</h3><p>混合变现的核心挑战是避免广告&quot;侵蚀&quot;IAP 收入——让免费用户通过广告贡献价值，而不让付费用户觉得&quot;花了钱还要看广告&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    U[活跃用户] --&gt; SEG{付费状态?}&#10;    SEG --&gt;|从未付费| FP[免费用户&lt;br/&gt;全量广告]&#10;    SEG --&gt;|首充用户| LP[低付费&lt;br/&gt;减少插屏/保留激励]&#10;    SEG --&gt;|高付费| HP[高付费&lt;br/&gt;移除所有非激励广告]&#10;    FP --&gt; R1[广告收入为主]&#10;    LP --&gt; R2[IAP + 广告混合]&#10;    HP --&gt; R3[纯 IAP 收入]\">flowchart LR\n    U[活跃用户] --&gt; SEG{付费状态?}\n    SEG --&gt;|从未付费| FP[免费用户&lt;br/&gt;全量广告]\n    SEG --&gt;|首充用户| LP[低付费&lt;br/&gt;减少插屏/保留激励]\n    SEG --&gt;|高付费| HP[高付费&lt;br/&gt;移除所有非激励广告]\n    FP --&gt; R1[广告收入为主]\n    LP --&gt; R2[IAP + 广告混合]\n    HP --&gt; R3[纯 IAP 收入]</pre><p>分层广告策略的收入对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>免费用户 ARPDAU</th>\n<th>付费用户 ARPDAU</th>\n<th>整体 ARPDAU</th>\n<th>D7 留存影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无广告</td>\n<td>$0</td>\n<td>$0.50</td>\n<td>$0.03</td>\n<td>基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全量广告</td>\n<td>$0.08</td>\n<td>$0.45</td>\n<td>$0.10</td>\n<td>-3pp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层广告</td>\n<td>$0.08</td>\n<td>$0.52</td>\n<td>$0.11</td>\n<td>-1pp</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"广告与付费转化的关系\">广告与付费转化的关系</h3><p>激励视频实际上可以<strong>促进</strong>首充转化——让玩家体验到&quot;高级内容&quot;的价值后产生付费动机：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def measure_ad_to_iap_lift(cohort_data):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;测量激励视频观看对首充转化的提升&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    watched_group = cohort_data[cohort_data.rewarded_videos_d1_3 &gt;= 3]&#10;    no_watch_group = cohort_data[cohort_data.rewarded_videos_d1_3 == 0]&#10;&#10;    cvr_watched = watched_group.first_purchase_d30.mean()&#10;    cvr_no_watch = no_watch_group.first_purchase_d30.mean()&#10;&#10;    lift = (cvr_watched - cvr_no_watch) / cvr_no_watch * 100&#10;    return {&#10;        &#39;cvr_with_ads&#39;: cvr_watched,&#10;        &#39;cvr_without_ads&#39;: cvr_no_watch,&#10;        &#39;lift_pct&#39;: lift  # 通常为 +20-40%&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> measure_ad_to_iap_lift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cohort_data):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"测量激励视频观看对首充转化的提升\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    watched_group </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohort_data[cohort_data.rewarded_videos_d1_3 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    no_watch_group </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohort_data[cohort_data.rewarded_videos_d1_3 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cvr_watched </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> watched_group.first_purchase_d30.mean()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cvr_no_watch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> no_watch_group.first_purchase_d30.mean()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lift </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cvr_watched </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cvr_no_watch) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cvr_no_watch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'cvr_with_ads'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: cvr_watched,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'cvr_without_ads'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: cvr_no_watch,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'lift_pct'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: lift  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 通常为 +20-40%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"关键监控指标\">关键监控指标</h2><p>日常运营需要监控的广告指标体系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>健康基准</th>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Fill Rate</td>\n<td>填充请求/总请求</td>\n<td>&gt;95%</td>\n<td>&lt;85%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Show Rate</td>\n<td>实际展示/已填充</td>\n<td>&gt;80%</td>\n<td>&lt;60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eCPM</td>\n<td>千次展示收入</td>\n<td>因地区和形式而异</td>\n<td>7日均值下降&gt;20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARPDAU (Ad)</td>\n<td>日广告收入/DAU</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.05</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.05-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>0.15</td>\n<td>周环比下降&gt;15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Completion Rate</td>\n<td>视频完整播放率</td>\n<td>&gt;90% (激励)</td>\n<td>&lt;80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Imp/DAU</td>\n<td>人均日展示次数</td>\n<td>3-8 (激励)</td>\n<td>超出上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与其他模块的关系\">与其他模块的关系</h2><ul>\n<li>广告收入是<a href=\"revenue-metrics-ltv\">收入指标</a>中 LTV 计算的重要组成部分</li>\n<li>广告频次优化依赖<a href=\"../live-ops/ab-testing-experimentation\">A/B 测试平台</a>的精确实验</li>\n<li>分层广告策略基于<a href=\"../player-behavior/player-segmentation\">玩家分群</a>的付费倾向标签</li>\n<li>广告对留存的影响需要通过<a href=\"../player-behavior/retention-engagement-analysis\">留存分析</a>持续监控</li>\n<li>游戏内广告奖励的经济价值需要与<a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/\">游戏经济平衡</a>对齐——广告奖励过高会侵蚀 IAP 需求</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>广告变现的核心命题是在&quot;用户体验&quot;与&quot;收入最大化&quot;之间找到最优平衡点。激励视频是体验与效率兼得的最佳形式；聚合（Mediation）通过多网络竞价最大化每次展示价值，2026 年实时竞价已成主流；混合变现按付费倾向分层——让免费用户通过广告贡献价值，同时不损害付费用户体验。关键监控指标为 Fill Rate、eCPM、ARPDAU(Ad)、Show Rate，并通过 A/B 测试精确校准广告频次与留存的权衡曲线。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"广告变现与聚合优化","id":"广告变现与聚合优化"},{"level":2,"text":"广告变现在游戏中的定位","id":"广告变现在游戏中的定位"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"广告形式与适用场景","id":"广告形式与适用场景"},{"level":3,"text":"激励视频：广告变现的支柱","id":"激励视频-广告变现的支柱"},{"level":2,"text":"广告聚合（Mediation）","id":"广告聚合-mediation"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么需要聚合","id":"为什么需要聚合"},{"level":3,"text":"瀑布流 vs 实时竞价","id":"瀑布流-vs-实时竞价"},{"level":2,"text":"eCPM 优化","id":"ecpm-优化"},{"level":3,"text":"影响 eCPM 的因素","id":"影响-ecpm-的因素"},{"level":3,"text":"地理分层定价","id":"地理分层定价"},{"level":3,"text":"A/B 测试广告频次","id":"a-b-测试广告频次"},{"level":2,"text":"混合变现策略","id":"混合变现策略"},{"level":3,"text":"IAP + IAA 协同","id":"iap-iaa-协同"},{"level":3,"text":"广告与付费转化的关系","id":"广告与付费转化的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"关键监控指标","id":"关键监控指标"},{"level":2,"text":"与其他模块的关系","id":"与其他模块的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"定价与内购优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-analytics/monetization-analytics/pricing-iap-optimization"},"next":{"title":"A/B 测试与实验平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-analytics/live-ops/ab-testing-experimentation"}}